### GPUI Component

The following crates are forks (modified copies) of
[`longbridge/gpui-component`](https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-component),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- `crates/ui` (upstream: `crates/ui`)
- `crates/ui_macros` (upstream: `crates/macros`)

Upstream copyright: Copyright 2024 - 2025 Longbridge <https://longbridge.com>

Vendored at git revision `b7e63cc29018c27bb24788ddb212f4cbdd861334`
(version 0.5.2 / 0.5.1).

The SVG icon files under `assets/icons/` are also vendored from the same
upstream revision (the icon set previously shipped by the upstream
`crates/assets` crate, which has been consolidated into this project's own
`assets/icons` directory and is managed by the project owner).

Modifications made to this project: the crates above were copied into this
repository and adapted to build as part of this workspace, including
rewriting their dependency references and wiring their theming into this
project's own `workspace` crate. The internationalization system
(`rust_i18n`) and the `time` (calendar/date-picker), `chart`, and `setting`
modules were removed, along with their now-unused dependencies. The upstream
`crates/assets` crate (icon ownership) was removed entirely; `gpui_component`
now generates its `IconName` enum from this project's `assets/icons`
directory. Any further edits are made by this project and are subject to the
Apache License, Version 2.0 terms.

